        "text": "According to eBay Inc., eBay Inc. argues that the appellate court\u2019s rule presumes three of the four traditional injunction factors are satisfied whenever a jury finds a patent valid and infringed."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "eBay Inc.",
        "citations": [
          {
