            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to eBay Inc., eBay Inc. contends that the public interest does not justify denying an injunction in this case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Phillips",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "603600e9155e281b72d6931bde2cc9b191086245a98adb5abda24faebc9820c4",
