            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Phillips, mr. Phillips states that the district court found full infringement trials appropriate based on the balance of hardships, and that finding has not been challenged on appeal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Phillips",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "603600e9155e281b72d6931bde2cc9b191086245a98adb5abda24faebc9820c4",
            "evidence_ids": [
